WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.260
InSight, listening.

00:01.973 --> 00:03.318
InSight never moved.

00:03.661 --> 00:08.790
It set a seismometer on the ground and listened, and heard more than thirteen hundred marsquakes.

00:09.229 --> 00:12.894
From the way they echoed, we know Mars has a core of liquid metal.

00:13.457 --> 00:17.622
Dust covered its solar panels, and it fell silent in 2022.
